      "jcr:created": "Mon Apr 17 2023 18:16:30 GMT+0000",
      "text": "Defying the odds Lin’s battle with colon cancer When Lin was diagnosed with stage 3 colon cancer, he was told he only had 6 months to live. Learn how a trusting relationship with a doctor, the right technology, and the support of his family helped guide him to remission. “It’s been more than two years now since I was totally cleared and my quality of life now…has changed quite a bit,” he says. “After going through this experience and knowing what I know now, I would highly suggest having a colonoscopy when they recommend those at 45. Pay attention to your own health.” ______________ Lin Smith Colorectal cancer survivor Learn more about surgical visualization",
